    "name": "Fivitel Boutique Da Nang",
    "detail": "I always booked a hotel near the beach when I visited Da Nang. This time I spent a day at Fivitel Boutique Da Nang Hotel. When I arrived at the hotel by taxi, my young friend was very kind to meet me. The check-in counter two women Amy and Ms, Ivy were much more friendly. I stayed at a hotel in Vietnam many times, but this is the first time I have seen such a kind woman. When I talked to the two women after seeing the little paint peeling off from the facilities inside the hotel, they sincerely apologized to me. To compensate for my inconvenience, they called a taxi going to the airport and provided taxi assistance. Rather I was sorry for the kindness to the customer so beautiful. Kim from Korea",
